Boris, the Phase 2 project manual is reissued today with Section 09 05 61 r=
estored verbatim for guestroom floors 9 through 14, on Delmarco's written d=
irection of April 8.<br />
<br />
The section is unchanged from the original: a two coat epoxy moisture vapor=
 mitigation system over the full guestroom and corridor slab area, with in =
situ relative humidity by ASTM F2170 verified at or below 85 percent before=
 any resilient flooring or adhesive is placed, and no flooring until the sy=
stem is installed and cured.<br />
<br />
For the avoidance of doubt, ASI-018 has no application to Phase 2. Please m=
ake sure your estimating group is pricing floors 9 through 14 with the syst=
em in and not carrying last year's credit forward.